{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10019","headline":"松滋江北阻风 · 阎宽","name":"松滋江北阻风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江风久未歇，山雨复相仍。\n巨浪天涯起，余寒川上凝。\n忧人劳夕惕，乡事惫晨兴。\n远听知音骇，诚哉不可陵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎宽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}